"\n"
"\n"
"እባክዎን ችግሩን ያሳውቁን በ መቃኛ በ http://bugs.launchpad.net/ubuntu/+source/ubuntu-"
"release-upgrader/+filebug and attach the files in /var/log/dist-upgrade/ to "
